# NV-14 — Quy trinh tra loi

UC: 142-161  
Actors: reception, coordinator, specialist, leader, system administrator  
Status: P0 status transitions mocked; full workflow pending.

## Scope

Receive/filter, assign/return/reject/merge, draft answer, legal basis, collaboration, submit/review, revise, official document, e-sign, publish/recall, extension, reminders, close/archive.

## Acceptance criteria

- Every transition validates current state, actor permission, required content and SLA.
- Published answers require approval and immutable audit trail.
- Recall removes public visibility without deleting history.
- Extension and overdue events notify responsible actors and leaders.

